    "detailed_description": "A classic Sudoku puzzle is a puzzle in which you have to place the numbers 1-9 in 9 cells that are in one of nine boxes.  The cells are arranged in 3x3 grids and the boxes are also arranged in a 3x3 grid.  The numbers must be placed in such a way that no digit is duplicated within a row, column, or box.  Symbol Sudoku takes this idea to another level by replacing the numbers with Greek symbols.<br><br>As you solve the puzzles, you can mark the ones you like as favorites and can then generate new custom puzzles based on those favorites for infinite replayability!<br><br>The following options can be enabled/disabled:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Candidates/pencil marks turn red if they are invalid<br></li><li> Candidates/pencil marks are removed when a value is placed that invalidates the mark<br></li><li> Undo/redo moves<br></li><li> Use alternate symbols (Greek symbols)<br></li><li> Whether the grid layout starts with 1 in the upper-left or mimics the numpad and starts in the lower-left</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Minimalist design<br></li><li> Keyboard shortcuts<br></li><li> Relaxing music<br></li><li> 5 different difficulty levels<br></li><li> Comes with 250 puzzles<br></li><li> Can generate infinite puzzles based on your favorites</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A classic Sudoku puzzle is a puzzle in which you have to place the numbers 1-9 in 9 cells that are in one of nine boxes.  The cells are arranged in 3x3 grids and the boxes are also arranged in a 3x3 grid.  The numbers must be placed in such a way that no digit is duplicated within a row, column, or box.  Symbol Sudoku takes this idea to another level by replacing the numbers with Greek symbols.<br><br>As you solve the puzzles, you can mark the ones you like as favorites and can then generate new custom puzzles based on those favorites for infinite replayability!<br><br>The following options can be enabled/disabled:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Candidates/pencil marks turn red if they are invalid<br></li><li> Candidates/pencil marks are removed when a value is placed that invalidates the mark<br></li><li> Undo/redo moves<br></li><li> Use alternate symbols (Greek symbols)<br></li><li> Whether the grid layout starts with 1 in the upper-left or mimics the numpad and starts in the lower-left</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Minimalist design<br></li><li> Keyboard shortcuts<br></li><li> Relaxing music<br></li><li> 5 different difficulty levels<br></li><li> Comes with 250 puzzles<br></li><li> Can generate infinite puzzles based on your favorites</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Classic Sudoku, but with a twist--solve the game using Greek symbols.",
